Description: Native R mirror of the canonical 'tsinfer' method for inferring
    tree sequences (ancestral recombination graphs) from genetic variation
    data, as described in Kelleher et al. (2019) <doi:10.1038/s41588-019-0483-y>.
    The package bundles the 'tsinfer' and 'tskit' C libraries and provides
    the three-stage inference pipeline (ancestor generation, Li and Stephens
    haplotype matching and post-processing), multi-threaded matching, a
    built-in reader and writer for the 'Zarr' storage format used by VCF
    Zarr ('VCZ') stores, and conversion of 'VCF' files to 'VCZ'. No 'Python'
    installation is required.
